WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:18.072
How do you trust a proof checker?

00:18.072 --> 00:35.000
You have p. You promised q.

00:35.000 --> 00:52.135
Names alone are not enough.

00:52.135 --> 01:07.956
Unsupported means refused.

01:07.956 --> 01:23.153
Know what you are trusting.

01:23.153 --> 01:49.987
Run both sides.
